<section>
<div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 &mdash; Workforce</span><h2>Personal y Cobertura</h2>
<p class="desc">Distribucion del personal por departamento y turno</p></div></div>
<div class="grid-2">
<div class="panel">
<h4 class="chart-title">Distribucion por Departamento</h4>
<p class="chart-sub">398 colaboradores en 3 departamentos</p>
<div class="pie-container">
<div class="pie-chart" style="background:conic-gradient(#0B5FA5 0deg 209deg, #7A3EBF 209deg 347deg, #1E9E6C 347deg 360deg)"></div>
<ul class="pie-legend">
<li><span class="dot" style="background:#0B5FA5"></span><span class="lbl">Inbound</span><span class="val">231 (58.0%)</span></li>
<li><span class="dot" style="background:#7A3EBF"></span><span class="lbl">Outbound</span><span class="val">153 (38.4%)</span></li>
<li><span class="dot" style="background:#1E9E6C"></span><span class="lbl">ICQA</span><span class="val">14 (3.5%)</span></li>
